{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>俄羅斯堪察加半島6.9級地震，日本氣象廳一度誤報9.9級，但其後已經取消有關警報。(網上圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>本港時間今日(16日)上午11時35分俄羅斯堪察加半島發生一次6.9級地震，即彼得羅巴甫洛夫斯克之西南約150公里，震源深度約10公里，未有發出海嘯警告。 日本氣象廳一度誤報地震規模為9.9級，但其後已經取消有關警報。氣象廳正調查誤報原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T05:19:49.531959+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T04:09:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T05:17:41.216737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:17:41.216737+00:00","content_hash":"916bfd15039b67efed558fe2a0390f6fcccb2638e7ca80f75808ae7f052d53b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}